00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:21.780
The uncertain middle is discarded, which keeps bad pseudo-
labels out.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:28.590
Step by step the prototypes leave the text region and settle
on the real visual clusters.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:33.564
Assembled, the algorithm is nine lines.

00:10:34.014 --> 00:10:47.694
