dataset. The state is just K plus L vectors and two integers.

00:10:59.382 --> 00:11:08.646
And the final score has exactly the same shape as NegLabel.
Mass on the ID prototypes divided by mass over all prototypes.

00:11:09.096 --> 00:11:16.632
The only change is that w has replaced r. A learned visual
prototype instead of a text embedding.

